          "source_block": 1,
          "candidate_block": 1,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 0.18,
          "text": "CCECC FUZHOU SURVEY & DESIGN\nINSTITUTE CO. Domestic Project Management Measures for Business Operations"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 3,
          "candidate_block": 3,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.111,
          "text": "Chapter 1 General Provisions"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 4,
          "candidate_block": 4,
          "candidate_line_count": 7,
          "center_error": 20.575,
          "text": "Article 1 In accordance with the guiding opinions of the Joint-Stock Company\non high-quality business operations, and in conjunction with the relevant\nrequirements of the Group Company's Implementation Rules for High-Quality\nBusiness Operations (Trial) (Zhongtu Jingying [2024] No. 341), these Measures are\nspecially formulated to comprehensively improve the quality of project business\noperations, effectively manage the company's domestic business operations, and\nstandardize business procedures and workflows."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 8,
          "candidate_block": 5,
          "candidate_line_count": 4,
          "center_error": 12.793,
          "text": "Article 2 For the purposes of these Measures, \"projects\" refer to various types of\ncompany business operations undertaken through direct entrustment or bidding,\nincluding consulting, investigation, design, supervision, and engineering general\ncontracting."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 10,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 22.285,
          "text": "Article 3 In principle, business undertaking work shall follow the procedure of\nproject evaluation first, then application for approval, and finally contract signing."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 12,
          "candidate_block": 7,
          "candidate_line_count": 8,
          "center_error": 17.293,
          "text": "Article 4 When carrying out project business undertaking work, factors such as\nthe company's development strategy, business direction, responsibility cost,\nproduction and technical capabilities and current status shall be comprehensively\nconsidered, and in accordance with the process provisions of these Measures, the\nwork of such stages as \"information tracking, project evaluation and application, bid\ndocument preparation and review, contract negotiation, contract review and signing,\nowner services during project implementation, and project return visits\" shall be\ncompleted."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 17,
          "candidate_block": 8,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.127,
          "text": "Chapter 2 Relevant Responsibilities"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 18,
          "candidate_block": 9,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 19.147,
          "text": "Article 5 The Business Development Department is the management\ndepartment for the company's domestic project business work and is responsible for\nthe layout and expansion of the company's business market."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 20,
          "candidate_block": 10,
          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 28.307,
          "text": "Article 6 The relevant personnel involved in the project operation work and\ntheir main responsibilities are shown in Table 1:"
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "role": "centered_text",
          "source_block": 1,
          "candidate_block": 1,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.148,
          "text": "Table 1 Main Responsibilities of Personnel Participating in Business Contracting Work"
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
